squo;s 6 grids in Shelby County runs from 1951 to 2025, and June to July came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, June to July ran 170% of normal on the middle, while April to May sat at 64%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 60% and June to July at 62% on the middle. Grid 26238 had its driest year in 1976 at 57%.</p>"}
